[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      2[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      3[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Goal: a byte-for-byte behavioural clone of MuJS 1.3.8 as a Rust `cdylib`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      4[0m:[38;5;10m[49m exporting the same 237 symbols. This is a **mechanical transliteration**, not a
